# No environment file, API key, billing account or downloaded ZIP is needed.
# Leaflet and public OpenStreetMap tiles work with the default configuration.
# Optional alternative tile service: provide BOTH values and follow its policy.
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=https://your-provider.example/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# VITE_MAP_ATTRIBUTION=Your provider attribution
# All VITE_ values are public in the browser. Never place secrets here.
